        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns the zero yield rate for the given date calculating it from the instantaneous forward rate <formula id="302">$ f(t) $</formula> as <formula id="394">\[ z(t) = \int_0^t f(\tau) d\tau \]</formula></para><para><xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000138"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>This default implementation uses an highly inefficient and possibly wildly inaccurate numerical integration. Derived classes should override it if a more efficient implementation is available. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>        </detaileddescription>
